name: disease-note
description: Explain a disease or term: etymology and pathogenesis
triggers: typed-order, new-empty-note
keywords: explain, what is, what does, don't get, dont get, mean, disease
subjects:
inputs: term
output: note
output_folder: /home/prime/Documents/Dentist/Notes/JARVIS_inbox
filename: {term}.md
reset_after: 30
---
PLACEHOLDER PROMPT (replace with your own).
Explain the term below for a dental student: first its etymology, then its pathogenesis.
Stay strictly within the scope of the lesson provided; do not over-explain.
Write in clean markdown.
--- followup ---
New term: {term}
Under heading: {heading}
Same lesson, same rules as before.
